      <section class="tour-section">
        <h2>Overview</h2>
        <p>Snorkel in Zanzibar's main marine conservation area at Mnemba Atoll. Spot green sea turtles, observe colorful reef fish on healthy coral reefs and enjoy fruit and water on a traditional dhow.</p>
