          <li>Marine conservation fee: $25 per non-EAC adult (included in our price)</li>
          <li>Best conditions: June–October and December–March</li>
          <li>Avoid "dolphins guaranteed" promises — they are unethical and often illegal</li>
          <li>Weather dependent; trips may be rescheduled if seas are rough</li>
        </ul>
      </section>
      <section class="tour-section">
